<body>
    <h1>13.08.2026</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p>Attendees: Niels B. (chair), Didi K., Han T., Daniel B., Pedro S=
., Johan N., Harvard, Victoria N., Andrew W., Stian K., JP P, Mike JK, Petr=
i K., Richard W., Ivan M., Carlos M., Thomas L., Stein R., Jeff H., Rafael =
S., Martin S., Lukas H., Paola S.</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>AGENDA</p>
<ol>
 <li data-uuid=3D"9dfb84c0-af88-4add-b226-22c0b16f00ba">What has happened d=
uring the summer break? (Niels)</li>
</ol>
<ol>
 <li data-uuid=3D"01107c6a-6d33-4216-a68d-dba7303d0d8a">Short change reques=
t session (Johan)</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"98657678-6fd7-464e-ada0-bb93def7fee2">IBC demos (Paola / =
Niels)</li>
 <ol>
  <li data-uuid=3D"a97ff03c-f84d-4906-9ac4-9d084c3cc63b">Demo pod, what equ=
ipment do we have available?</li>
  <li data-uuid=3D"388e6e24-5e8f-428d-99da-95f92678100f">Software (Loopic, =
Erizos, SPX, LiveOS, Davinci Resolve...?)</li>
  <li data-uuid=3D"66f7bb79-7f4c-4041-9fc3-743a5a2ac63f">Demo material&nbsp=
;</li>
  <li data-uuid=3D"e68e9c1b-5d5a-4390-b858-88977a2bc02b">Demo artist - who =
can allocate time to demo?</li>
 </ol>
 <li data-uuid=3D"92dbdd17-21ef-48ef-8717-47fb724dd660">Test and feedback D=
avinci Resolve implementation of OGraf (Niels)</li>
</ol>
<p><br></p>
<p>Meeting notes/actions</p>
<ol>
 <li data-uuid=3D"ea48a6d7-bb82-4bfc-a2a4-5afb485fcf46">Niels spoke about t=
he presentation on OGraf he gave at the Sweden Streaming event and ARD conf=
erence. He mentioned also the recording of the OGraf presentation for SMPTE=
</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"8c053502-786a-4162-a442-8f649426b77d">Johan went through =
the =E2=80=9Cissues=E2=80=9D on github, please check <a href=3D"https://git=
hub.com/ebu/ograf/issues" class=3D"external-link" rel=3D"nofollow">https://=
github.com/ebu/ograf/issues</a></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"39817303-5a3e-4bc9-84af-0b7ea50d65b3">The group agreed to=
 release v1 of the Server API (quarterly updates); Johan will make the nece=
ssary changes to publish v1 before IBC</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"0414c607-b9c8-4b3d-aaaa-525d018380bb">Paola to check with=
 EBU Comms about a news item on v1</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"7a2068bc-b944-4c1d-ad37-181a894dc4c1">IBC demos: showing =
from creation to live &amp; to post prod involving different vendors. Victo=
ria suggested to use the AI assistant in public beta to author a reposnsive=
 template. Ivan showed two tools to transform OGraf in video for NLE. Niels=
 asked for template aspect ratio agnostic and with transition logic, he is =
planning to present Sport, News and Election related templates. Everviz wil=
l provide maps template for the demo. Streamshapers can provide templates b=
ased on design guidelines provided by TV2. Niels and Paola will present OGr=
aft during a SMPTE session at IBC on Saturday afternoon. Johan will work on=
 a demo on the Control API using Sofie automation system</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"8f91622a-e829-4724-9e4e-1aba7a0d4dca">Blackmagic: Niels w=
ill be the contact point for J. Mansfield. YLE and Streamshapers said that =
the implementation on OGraf has improved since the first release but there =
are still bugs to be solgved (e.g., graphic is imported but without animati=
on, steps not implemented)</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"25e880ca-27a5-4813-961d-8a1e441fe6e0">All to specify thei=
r availability for the demos manning and content that can be used for the d=
emos in the shared doc provided by Niels</li>
</ol>
    </div>
